&lt;p&gt;The US national base salary range for this full-time position is $169,000 - $298,000. Our salary ranges are determined by role, level, and location. The range displayed on each job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire salaries for the position across all US locations. Within the range, individual pay is determined by work location and additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
