&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in final expense, whole life, or adjacent protection products strongly preferred; candidates with B2C insurance, insurtech, or high-velocity consumer sales backgrounds will be considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and managing agent compensation plans, performance management frameworks, and staffing models at scale&lt;/li&gt;
