&lt;p&gt;Do you want to make the world a better place for underwriters? Are you a natural leader who loves to mentor and guide? This role seeks a dynamic, hands-on individual who has the energy and vision to guide a developing team to high levels of success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% of this role will be dedicated to case underwriting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead the team with passion, positivity and continual improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Chief Underwriter, Sr. Director/Director of Underwriting Operations to recruit, hire, mentor, and develop underwriting staff both domestically and internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess quality and headcount&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform hiring analysis to flex with our growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and improve onboarding and underwriting training programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop performance management and quality control system to provide feedback, guidance and reviews to underwriting team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist underwriting staff to develop their technical and decision making skills, while ensuring adherence to our core values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic efforts to optimize underwriting workflows, including work to implement rules within an underwriting engine, recommending solutions and best practices as appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As needed, work with Underwriting Strategies to perform quality assurance testing of automated rules and processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in Life underwriting (US based underwriting experience is preferred)).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in an underwriting leadership or development role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Underwriting certification such as LOMA/ALU are highly beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of life insurance trends and new technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp focus on execution and an owner mentality with a track record of delivering success in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data oriented decision making skills and great intuition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
