&lt;li&gt;Experience in life insurance or related industry preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency working with Salesforce or equivalent support/help desk software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong intellectual curiosity and drive to solve problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and prioritization necessary to balance all responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
